meta {
  name: 2. List Open Offers
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/offers?status=open&limit=50&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  status: open
  limit: 50
  offset: 0
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # List Open Offers

  Returns paginated list of open trade offers from all users.

  ## Security:
  - Requires JWT authentication

  ## Query Parameters:
  - `status`: Filter by status (open, completed, cancelled)
  - `limit`: Number of results (default: 50)
  - `offset`: Pagination offset (default: 0)

  ## Response:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "creator_id": 2,
        "skin_offered_id": 5,
        "skin_requested_id": 3,
        "status": "open",
        "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:00:00Z",
        "skin_offered": {
          "id": 5,
          "name": "AWP | Dragon Lore",
          "rarity": "Covert",
          "market_price": 4500.00
        },
        "skin_requested": {
          "id": 3,
          "name": "M4A4 | Howl",
          "rarity": "Contraband",
          "market_price": 4200.00
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Use Cases:
  - Browse available trade offers
  - Find offers matching your inventory
  - Accept offers that interest you
}
